# Data. Raw/processed parquets, predictions and results ARE committed (~1 MB):
# the GitHub Actions race-weekend job (scripts/ci_tick.py) needs them as state.
# The FastF1 cache (~1 GB) is not; CI keeps it in actions/cache.
